1910789","categories":[{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u221e\u00a0<strong>About OpenDraft </strong>\u221e</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OpenDraft</strong>\u00a0was developed with the goal of improving work-flow, and built for anyone who needed a distraction-free environment to brainstorm, write, or doodle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed with simplicity in mind, it has an infinitely growing canvas, infinite text boxes, a customizable pencil (colour and size), and multiple ambient soundtracks built-in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u221e\u00a0<strong>Infinite Canvas</strong>: Draw and write without boundaries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u221e\u00a0<strong>Offline &amp; Secure</strong>: Everything is stored locally on your device.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u221e\u00a0<strong>Sketching</strong>: Customize your sketches and doodles with a customizable pencil tool!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u221e\u00a0<strong>Rich Text  Editing</strong>: Customize your writing  with adjustable fonts using <strong>RICH TEXT EDITING ONLY</strong>. E.g. <i>italics</i>, <strong>bold</strong>, <span class=\"bb_strike\">strike</span>, etc. This uses &lt;&gt; markers wrapping your text.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u221e\u00a0<strong>Ambient Soundtracks</strong>: Background soundscapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u221e\u00a0<strong>Auto/Manual Save</strong>: Auto-saves every five minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u221e\u00a0<strong>Paste Images From Clipboard:</strong> Any image in your clipboard can be placed on the canvas. Placed where your cursor is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean and minimalist.</p>","developers":["CrowsBeak"],"genres":[{"description":"Casua